{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (DOCTOR): Howzit, Mr Dlamini. Come through, have a seat. Robots on Main were dead again this morning.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0003] person_1 (DOCTOR): Shame. Whole queue of bakkies. Anyway — what can I do for you today?",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (PATIENT): I'm fine.",
  "[SEG0005] person_1 (DOCTOR): You're fine. But you booked, so something's sitting there?",
  "[SEG0006] person_2 (PATIENT): Sleep.",
  "[SEG0007] person_1 (DOCTOR): Sleep. Bad, or just short?",
  "[SEG0008] person_2 (PATIENT): Bad.",
  "[SEG0009] person_1 (DOCTOR): Falling asleep, waking up, or both?",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (PATIENT): Both.",
  "[SEG0011] person_1 (DOCTOR): How long, roughly?",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (PATIENT): Months.",
  "[SEG0013] person_1 (DOCTOR): Sorry, I jumped ahead. Can you put a number on it?",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (PATIENT): Four. Maybe five.",
  "[SEG0015] person_1 (DOCTOR): So both — can't drop off, and you wake in the night — for four, maybe five months?",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0017] person_1 (DOCTOR): What was going on around then?",
  "[SEG0018] person_2 (PATIENT): Lost my job. Retrenched.",
  "[SEG0019] person_1 (DOCTOR): Eish. I'm sorry. Was it sudden?",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0021] person_1 (DOCTOR): How has the energy been since the retrenchment?",
  "[SEG0022] person_2 (PATIENT): Low. All day.",
  "[SEG0023] person_1 (DOCTOR): And the things you enjoyed — soccer, a braai — how do you feel about those now?",
  "[SEG0024] person_2 (PATIENT): Can't be bothered.",
  "[SEG0025] person_1 (DOCTOR): Tell me about your appetite.",
  "[SEG0026] person_2 (PATIENT): Normal.",
  "[SEG0027] person_1 (DOCTOR): And the weight?",
  "[SEG0028] person_2 (PATIENT): Steady.",
  "[SEG0029] person_1 (DOCTOR): Any pain or headaches with all this?",
  "[SEG0030] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0031] person_1 (DOCTOR): How would you describe the mood — flat, sad, irritable?",
  "[SEG0032] person_2 (PATIENT): Flat. Empty, sometimes.",
  "[SEG0033] person_1 (DOCTOR): Who have you been able to tell?",
  "[SEG0034] person_2 (PATIENT): My wife. She knows. She made me come.",
  "[SEG0035] person_1 (DOCTOR): I need to ask this gently, and no is a perfectly fine answer. Any thoughts of hurting yourself, or of not wanting to be alive, even on a bad night?",
  "[SEG0036] person_2 (PATIENT): No. Never.",
  "[SEG0037] person_1 (DOCTOR): Thank you for saying it straight. How's your concentration, compared with before?",
  "[SEG0038] person_2 (PATIENT): Worse.",
  "[SEG0039] person_1 (DOCTOR): During the day, do you find yourself nodding off?",
  "[SEG0040] person_2 (PATIENT): No. Can't get going.",
  "[SEG0041] person_1 (DOCTOR): Load shedding knocked our vaccine fridge yesterday — ag, not your worry. Are you on any medication at the moment?",
  "[SEG0042] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0043] person_1 (DOCTOR): Did you try anything from the chemist for the sleep, even briefly?",
  "[SEG0044] person_2 (PATIENT): Stopped.",
  "[SEG0045] person_1 (DOCTOR): What was it you stopped?",
  "[SEG0046] person_2 (PATIENT): Um, the blue one, Stilnox I think. Half a tablet for a couple of nights, then I stopped.",
  "[SEG0047] person_1 (DOCTOR): Zolpidem for sleep, then — half a tablet for a couple of nights, and it did nothing so you stopped?",
  "[SEG0048] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0049] person_1 (DOCTOR): Have you had blood tests before, thyroid or a TSH?",
  "[SEG0050] person_2 (PATIENT): Last year. They said the TSH was borderline. Said leave it.",
  "[SEG0051] person_1 (DOCTOR): My working sense is a low mood after the retrenchment. I can't rule out that thyroid playing a part until we repeat the bloods.",
  "[SEG0052] person_2 (PATIENT): Okay.",
  "[SEG0053] person_1 (DOCTOR): I'd like to repeat the TSH and do a full blood count. I'm not starting a tablet today.",
  "[SEG0054] person_2 (PATIENT): Not today.",
  "[SEG0055] person_1 (DOCTOR): Not today, ja. If those bloods come back fine we can talk about something like sertraline, but only then.",
  "[SEG0056] person_2 (PATIENT): Maybe.",
  "[SEG0057] person_1 (DOCTOR): Till then, same wake-up time, phone out of the bed, and a short walk if you can. Come back in two weeks with the results, better or not. If the sleep crashes, or any thought of hurting yourself shows up, phone us or go to casualty. Sharp?",
  "[SEG0058] person_2 (PATIENT): Sharp."
 ],
